public_suffix_list.txt is derived from the Public Suffix List,
https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat (fetched 2026-11-18),
converted by tools/rbrowse/psl2txt.py to lowercase ASCII rules (Unicode
labels in their IDNA "xn--" form), sorted.

